  "goodToKnow": "Veranlagt means inclined, gifted or predisposed by nature, usually with an adverb: musikalisch, sportlich, praktisch veranlagt. Die Veranlagung is a disposition or talent, and genetisch veranlagt means genetically predisposed. In tax language, die Veranlagung is the tax assessment: Ehepaare können sich gemeinsam veranlagen lassen (file jointly). From die Anlage (aptitude)."
